Please provide one of the following:
- Patient MRN (preferred) or FHIR Patient ID
- If MRN isn’t available: full name + DOB (YYYY-MM-DD) so I can confirm exactly one match

Once confirmed, I will:
1) Retrieve today’s blood pressure vitals for 07:00–09:00 (category=vital-signs), filter to BP entries (e.g., LOINC 85354-9 or code/text “BP”), and take the 6 most recent within that window.
