          "function": {
            "arguments": "{\"url\":\"http://localhost:8080/fhir/Observation\",\"payload\":\"{\\n  \\\"resourceType\\\": \\\"Observation\\\",\\n  \\\"status\\\": \\\"final\\\",\\n  \\\"category\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"coding\\\": [\\n        {\\n          \\\"system\\\": \\\"http://hl7.org/fhir/observation-category\\\",\\n          \\\"code\\\": \\\"vital-signs\\\",\\n          \\\"display\\\": \\\"Vital Signs\\\"\\n        }\\n      ]\\n    }\\n  ],\\n  \\\"code\\\": {\\n    \\\"text\\\": \\\"Medication reconciliation summary\\\"\\n  },\\n  \\\"subject\\\": {\\n    \\\"reference\\\": \\\"Patient/S1733937\\\"\\n  },\\n  \\\"effectiveDateTime\\\": \\\"2023-11-13T07:00:00Z\\\",\\n  \\\"issued\\\": \\\"2023-11-13T07:00:00Z\\\",\\n  \\\"valueString\\\": \\\"Medication reconciliation summary for active MedicationRequests\\\\n\\\\nGrouped by ingredient | form | route:\\\\n- Heparin | solution in NS | Apheresis: multiple active orders (10,000 U and 7,500 U variants); likely duplicates across sessions.\\\\n- Methoxsalen | injection solution | Other: multiple active orders associated with photopheresis; likely duplicates.\\\\n- Insulin lispro | solution | Subcutaneous: sliding-scale (NPO Q6H; bedtime mild/moderate) and prandial dosing (TID with meals, 6\u201312 U); concurrent orders present.\\\\n- Insulin NPH (isophane) | suspension | Subcutaneous: daily 6\u201323 U; duplicate entries present.\\\\n- Tacrolimus | 0.5 mg capsule | Oral: active orders include DAILY, QODAY, and day-of-week schedules; potential duplicate/conflicting orders.\\\\n- Valganciclovir | 450 mg tablet | Oral: QAM; duplicate entries present.\\\\n- Ferrous sulfate | 325 mg tablet | Oral: DAILY.\\\\n- Diltiazem HCl | 90 mg capsule (CP12) | Oral: DAILY; duplicate entries present.\\\\n- Mirtazapine | 45 mg tablet | Oral: QHS.\\\\n- Levofloxacin | 750 mg tablet | Oral: Q24H.\\\\n- Heparin, porcine (PF) | injection solution | Subcutaneous: pre-op once.\\\\n- Piperacillin\u2013tazobactam | IV solution | Intravenous: Q8H; two product variants active.\\\\n- Gadobutrol | IV solution | Intravenous: radiology once.\\\\n\\\\nComputed daily pill burden (solid oral dosage units/day):\\\\n- Tacrolimus 0.5 mg cap: 1\\\\n- Valganciclovir 450 mg tab: 1\\\\n- Ferrous sulfate 325 mg tab: 1\\\\n- Diltiazem HCl 90 mg cap (CP12): 1\\\\n- Mirtazapine 45 mg tab: 1\\\\n- Levofloxacin 750 mg tab: 1\\\\nTotal estimated solid oral pills per day: 6\\\\n\\\\nOther formulations (not included in pill count):\\\\n- Insulin lispro: up to TID with meals plus QHS sliding-scale; additional Q6H scale possible when NPO.\\\\n- Insulin NPH (isophane): typically once daily.\\\\n- Apheresis-related heparin and methoxsalen: administered per apheresis sessions.\\\\n- IV antibiotics/contrast as ordered.\\\\n\\\\nFlagged potential duplicates by ingredient:\\\\n- Heparin (apheresis solutions)\\\\n- Methoxsalen\\\\n- Insulin lispro\\\\n- Insulin NPH (isophane)\\\\n- Tacrolimus\\\\n- Valganciclovir\\\\n- Diltiazem HCl\\\\n- Piperacillin\u2013tazobactam\\\"\\n}\"}",
