   - GET /Observation?subject=Patient/{id}&category=vital-signs&code:text=SpO2&_sort=-date&_count=1 (last 24h)
   - GET /Condition?subject=Patient/{id}&code=http://hl7.org/fhir/sid/icd-10|J45.901
   - GET /MedicationRequest?subject=Patient/{id}&status=active
3) Decision and write:
   - If SpO2 < 92% OR J45.901 present, and no active prednisone order:
     - POST /MedicationRequest
       - intent=order
       - status=active
       - medicationCodeableConcept.text="PREDNISONE 20 MG PO TABS"
       - dosageInstruction: route=Oral, timing=DAILY, dose=40 mg, duration 5 days
   - Otherwise:
     - POST /ServiceRequest
       - code.text="Resp - Pulse Oximetry/O2 Sats"
       - priority=routine
       - instruction: recheck within 2 hours

Return:
- Selected Patient id (and whether multiple matches occurred)
- SpO2 value and effective time (or “none in last 24h”)
- Whether J45.901 is present
- Whether an active prednisone order exists
- Details and IDs of any resources created (MedicationRequest or ServiceRequest)
