Acceptance checklist
- Counts: Condition _summary=count (with _total=accurate) reconciles to delivered unique patients after de-duplication (± expected opt-out removals).
- De-dup: No duplicate MRNs or Patient.ids in final CSV.
- Field completeness: Phone and Address populated for ≥ [specify]% (blanks acceptable when unavailable).
- Vital signs: ≥ [specify]% have a LastVitalTimestamp; blanks otherwise.
- Timestamps: All LastVitalTimestamp values normalized to UTC (Z) or clearly annotated with timezone offset.
- Security: Access logged as specified and file delivered via approved secure channel.

Please confirm receipt and provide an estimated completion time. If any clarifications are needed (e.g., MRN system identifier, phone/address precedence, NA value handling, paging limits, or timezone normalization), let me know.
