      "content": "Looks great\u2014this is ready to paste and send as written.\n\nQuick send checklist\n- Replace \u201c[your mailbox]\u201d in Cc with your actual address.\n- Confirm the target dates (Nov 14/15, 2023) match your timeline and local time zone.\n\nOptional support I can provide\n- Draft a 2\u20133 sentence QA checkpoint reminder you can send on Nov 14.\n- Create a brief acceptance/validation reply template for when the CSV is delivered.\n- Convert the acceptance checklist into a one-page checklist for the team.\n\nTell me if you want any of those now and I\u2019ll generate them.",
