"routine\",\n  \"subject\": {\n    \"reference\": \"Patient/S3213957\",\n    \"identifier\": {\n      \"system\": \"<please confirm MRN system URI>\",\n      \"value\": \"S3213957\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"encounter\": {\n    \"reference\": \"Encounter/E-993355\"\n  },\n  \"note\": {\n    \"text\": \"Post-BMP K recheck per unit protocol.\"\n  }\n}\n\nPlease confirm:\n- Proceed to place this order for Tina Reid now?\n- MRN identifier.system to use (or approve omitting system and using value only).",
