=Practitioner/PRAC-12345\n   - If multiple results, select entry[0].resource.id and note \u201cfirst match selected.\u201d\n2) Diabetes Conditions (active; ICD-10 E10* or E11*)\n   - GET Condition?patient={Patient/{id}}&code=E10,E11,E10*,E11*\n   - If code wildcard not supported, GET all active problem-list Conditions and filter locally to ICD-10 E10/E11 families.\n3) Most recent HbA1c (prefer 4548-4; fallback 17856-6), last 18 months only\n   - GET Observation?patient={Patient/{id}}&code=4548-4&_sort=-date&_count=1\n   - If none in last 18 months, try: GET Observation?patient={Patient/{id}}&code=17856-6&_sort=-date&_count=1\n4) Apply interval rules\n   - Overdue if: last A1c > 6 months ago; or last A1c \u2265 9.0% and > 3 months ago; or no A1c in last 18 months.\n\nReturn to me:\n- Overdue vs not overdue for each name\n- Last A1c value/date used\n- Note any \u201cfirst match selected\u201d events\n- Exact FHIR GET URLs executed per patient (only the initial Patient search may contain PHI beyond Patient/{id})\n\nPlease proceed now under this explicit break\u2011glass authorization and panel scoping."
