- Units: Ensure all BP values are in mmHg before averaging; if mixed, convert or exclude outliers.
- Medication filtering: Maintain a local, up-to-date list of antihypertensive ingredients/brands (RxNorm or SNOMED) and map via code or case-insensitive text match. Consider reportedBoolean to separate patient-reported meds if needed.
- Orders in production: Follow local policy for allergy checks, renal function review, pregnancy status, and formulary/route defaults. Some APIs require status=active on create and may reject draft.

