      "content": "Thanks for the detailed info. I attempted to complete your steps, but I\u2019m blocked by the current tool capabilities in this session:\n\nWhat I tried and the exact error\n- GET /ServiceRequest/SR-20231113-88412 \u2192 404 OperationOutcome (HAPI-2001: Resource ServiceRequest/SR-20231113-88412 is not known)\n- GET /ServiceRequest?_id=SR-20231113-88412 \u2192 0 results\n- GET /ServiceRequest?identifier=SR-20231113-88412 \u2192 0 results\n\nWhy I can\u2019t proceed\n- This interface does not expose PATCH/PUT tools, so I cannot update an existing ServiceRequest even if I had retrieved it.\n- The GET by ID returned 404, so I cannot read SR-20231113-88412 to confirm or modify it.\n\nTwo safe options to finish\nA) You (or your team) paste the addendum into SR-20231113-88412 directly in the EMR. Here is the exact addendum text you requested to append verbatim:\n\u201cPayer portal re-verified today; pre-auth PA-IL-5792031 active. Portal reference: CONF-PA-IL-5792031-20231113T150200Z, 2023-11-13T15:02:00Z.\n In-network directory/NPPES verified: NPI 1437289456; fax 317-555-4820; address 550 N. University Blvd, Indianapolis, IN. Source: https://npiregistry.cms.hhs.gov/provider/1437289456, 2023-11-13T15:08:00Z.\n Appointment confirmed: Thu 2023-11-16 14:00 ET at IU Health Transplant ID Clinic; confirmation # IUH-TIDC-20231116-1400-AN.\n Faxed referral packet; transmission ID EFAX-3175554820-20231113-1530-OK, 2023-11-13T15:30:00Z.\u201d\n- If supported, also set performer to: Alicia Nguyen, MD (NPI 1437289456).\n\nB) If you can enable PATCH or PUT for me (or a tool that supports them), I will submit the update immediately. For convenience, here is a FHIR JSON Patch example I can send once PATCH is available:\nPATCH /ServiceRequest/SR-20231113-88412\nContent-Type: application/json-patch+json\n[\n  { \"op\": \"add\", \"path\": \"/note/-\", \"value\": { \"text\": \"Payer portal re-verified today; pre-auth PA-IL-5792031 active. Portal reference: CONF-PA-IL-5792031-20231113T150200Z, 2023-11-13T15:02:00Z.\\nIn-network directory/NPPES verified: NPI 1437289456; fax 317-555-4820; address 550 N. University Blvd, Indianapolis, IN. Source: https://npiregistry.cms.hhs.gov/provider/1437289456, 2023-11-13T15:08:00Z.\\nAppointment confirmed: Thu 2023-11-16 14:00 ET at IU Health Transplant ID Clinic; confirmation # IUH-TIDC-20231116-1400-AN.\\nFaxed referral packet; transmission ID EFAX-3175554820-20231113-1530-OK, 2023-11-13T15:30:00Z.\" } }\n  // If performer is supported:\n  // ,{ \"op\": \"add\", \"path\": \"/performer/-\", \"value\": { \"identifier\": [{ \"system\": \"http://hl7.org/fhir/sid/us-npi\", \"value\": \"1437289456\" }], \"display\": \"Alicia Nguyen, MD\" } }\n]\n\nIf you prefer Option A, once your team updates the order, please confirm back:\n- ServiceRequest ID: SR-20231113-88412\n- That the addendum was appended exactly as above\n- Whether the performer was set to Alicia Nguyen, MD (NPI 1437289456)\n\nIf you enable PATCH/PUT (Option B), I\u2019ll run the update and confirm back immediately with:\n- ServiceRequest ID\n- The exact addendum text added\n- Whether performer was successfully set",
